    "sections": {
        "description": "The Translation Service theme is meticulously crafted for businesses, agencies, freelancers, translators, interpreters, language schools, linguists, content writers, and localization experts seeking a professional multilingual website and a strong international presence while supporting ecommerce functionality for selling translation packages, language courses, digital content, and localization services online through WooCommerce, making it ideal for online store building, dropshipping, and POD products for language learning; built with seamless multilingual compatibility and Polylang integration, it allows accurate translation of pages, posts, menus, and widgets, supporting automated or professional translations, and ensures global communication and cultural localization for international audiences; fully responsive, fast-loading, and SEO-optimized with Yoast SEO, the theme includes Contact Form 7 for inquiries and quote requests, customizable layouts, intuitive navigation, and high performance across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices; perfect for corporate translation companies, ecommerce stores requiring localization, creative portfolios, blogs, and international service-based businesses, this complete solution enhances digital reach, builds trust, and expands customer engagement worldwide. Demo:https://www.vwthemes.net/translation-service-pro/"
    },
